#: ../../source/docs/modules/followtest.rst:3 dca8a0f49a394d2d89d27f12612e9671
msgid "Follow Me Test"
msgstr "跟随飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/followtest.rst:9 d73fe4ff44a64a8da51e90eba728af6d
msgid ""
"This module commands the vehicle to follow another vehicle. The other "
"vehicle must be sending ``HOME_POSITION`` packets to MAVProxy."
msgstr "该模块命令飞行器跟随另一飞行器。被跟随的飞行器需向 MAVProxy 发送 ``HOME_POSITION`` 数据包。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/followtest.rst:12
#: 0bf74fd4876f44d4ae73a7e472158776
msgid ""
"Upon reaching the minimum distance ``radius`` to the other vehicle, it will "
"loiter in a circle around it."
msgstr "到达距另一飞行器最小距离 ``radius`` 后，将在其周围盘旋飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/followtest.rst:15
#: d97fe4e8581a4b4286939fdcfff925fb
msgid "This module will activate when it is loaded."
msgstr "该模块加载后即自动激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/followtest.rst:17
#: d5c8ff6f6c1f4ed996cd79cf9abc2a2a
msgid "It can be disabled by setting ``disable_msg`` to True."
msgstr "可通过将 ``disable_msg`` 设为 True 来禁用该模块。"

